{
  "id": "6a75519836b48448b0c45ce5",
  "title": "赤リンクは入り口",
  "created": 1786073497,
  "updated": 1786091026,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a75519836b48448b0c45ce5",
      "text": "赤リンクは入り口",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0886",
      "text": "from [赤リンクは行き止まり]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0887",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073545
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0888",
      "text": "[赤リンク]は[入り口]という感覚があるかも[seibe.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073550
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0889",
      "text": "　その単語・フレーズが使われた（現時点では）唯一の箇所への窓口",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a088a",
      "text": " これはわかる[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a088b",
      "text": " この指摘はありがたいです[suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a088c",
      "text": " 　「[コップに水が]…」みたいに、見る人によって、入り口になったり、行き止まりになったりするってことですね",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7552190000000000882784",
      "text": " 　 （数百とあったら入り口には見えないよなあ、と思う）",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073625,
      "updated": 1786073688
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a088d",
      "text": " 　そうですそうです、図で言うと[seibe.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a088e",
      "text": " 　 ページA —赤リンク— ページBを、",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a088f",
      "text": " 　 ページA ——→ ページbとみたり",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0890",
      "text": " 　 ページA ←—— ページBとみたり",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0891",
      "text": " 　  本来のリンク・被リンクの向きではないが、linksに出てくるのでこれも可能になっている",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0892",
      "text": " 　 ということ",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75957a0000000000798081",
      "text": " 　 ↑の図をmermaid記法で書くと…[suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786090874,
      "updated": 1786090932
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7595b50000000000798082",
      "text": " 　 　　code:mermaid",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786090933,
      "updated": 1786090945
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7595c00000000000798083",
      "text": "      graph LR",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786090945,
      "updated": 1786090945
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7595c00000000000798084",
      "text": "      P1(ページA)--- L1((赤リンク)) --- P2(ページB)",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786090945,
      "updated": 1786090945
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7595c00000000000798086",
      "text": "   　　code:mermaid",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786090945,
      "updated": 1786090945
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7595c00000000000798087",
      "text": "      graph LR",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786090945,
      "updated": 1786090945
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7595c00000000000798088",
      "text": "      P1(ページA)--> P2(ページB)",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786090945,
      "updated": 1786090945
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7595c0000000000079808a",
      "text": "   　　code:mermaid",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786090945,
      "updated": 1786090945
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7595c0000000000079808b",
      "text": "      graph RL",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786090945,
      "updated": 1786090945
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7595c0000000000079808c",
      "text": "      P2(ページB)--> P1(ページA)",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786090945,
      "updated": 1786090945
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7595c0000000000079808d",
      "text": "   これで合っていますか？間違っているところはありませんか？",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786090945,
      "updated": 1786091026
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0893",
      "text": " おもしろい視点[takker.icon][taktamur.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0894",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0895",
      "text": "赤リンクは将来つながるかもしれないハンドルとして捉えてる[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0896",
      "text": "　まだつながっていないフロンティア",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0897",
      "text": "　十年後に意外なところでつながるかもしれない",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0898",
      "text": "　一種の投資？",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a0899",
      "text": " 赤リンクは種まきかも",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a089a",
      "text": "それとは別に、[Scrapboxのリンクは実質強調表現]だとして、マーカー代わりに赤リンクを作ることもある",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a089b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75519800000000005a089c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786073497,
      "updated": 1786073497
    }
  ]
}